            "review_title": "Review at Gogi House",
            "review_text": "GNSSCYNN\n3 contributions\n1\nGOOD food here\nFeb 2019 • Couples\nThere are some good and bad in this restaurant.\nGood:\nA. Food is great especially the sauces.\n -Lot of choices from beef,pork,dumplings,sushis,bibimbops at hotpots.\n B.Price is ok,if you have a good appetite, go for a 300k vnd unlimited buffet ( its worth it ).\nC.location is good also.\nD. Staffs are very kind.\n\nBAD:\nA. Too much changing of the grilling plate. And because of that,,we always have to wait to again and again.\nB. No table assignments for the waiter(im not sure in this part ), because whenever we want to order,we have to wait for some waiters to pass by.\nAnd I thinks if we have our assigned waiter we dont have to talk and explain to them that we are not vietnamese.\n( I think we told them 6 times that we are not vietnamese, which is very irritating to us .)\nC. Slow serving of food. Some wasnt serve as well.\nD. More training for the waiters..im not a vietnamese but I know some works and I work as a waiter before so I know what is the proper way of talking inside the restaurant.\nSome waiters talk too loud also and some of them talk like a boss in front of the guests also.\n\nBut overall, gogi house is the best and always be back here.\nRead more\nWritten February 16, 2019",
